/**
 * @defgroup frontend Frontend
 * @{
 *
 * @brief Frontend implementation of the ArgusAI system
 *
 * The frontend module provides a modern, responsive web interface for interacting with
 * the ArgusAI system, built using React and TypeScript.
 *
 * @section frontend_components Components
 *
 * @subsection ui UI Components
 * The UI module contains reusable components:
 * - Image upload and preview
 * - Detection results visualization
 * - Configuration controls
 * - Status indicators
 *
 * @subsection api API Integration
 * The API integration module handles:
 * - REST API communication
 * - WebSocket connections
 * - Error handling
 * - Response processing
 *
 * @subsection state State Management
 * The state management module provides:
 * - Application state handling
 * - Configuration persistence
 * - User preferences
 * - Session management
 *
 * @section frontend_usage Usage
 * The frontend can be accessed through:
 * 1. Web browser at http://localhost:5173
 * 2. Mobile-responsive interface
 * 3. Progressive Web App (PWA) capabilities
 *
 * @section frontend_config Configuration
 * The frontend can be configured through:
 * - Environment variables
 * - Configuration files
 * - User interface settings
 *
 * @section frontend_dependencies Dependencies
 * Key dependencies include:
 * - React
 * - TypeScript
 * - Vite
 * - Material-UI
 * - Axios
 *
 * @section frontend_build Build Process
 * The frontend build process includes:
 * - TypeScript compilation
 * - Asset optimization
 * - Code splitting
 * - Production builds
 *
 * @}
 */ 